<noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-N9JQF2GN"
height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript>
<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

<header class="site-header">
<a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark">G</span><span>GrowthForge<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span></a>
<nav><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav>
<a class="header-cta" href={`mailto:${email}?subject=GrowthForge%20Freelance%20Enquiry`}>Let's Talk ↗</a>
</header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-copy">
<div class="eyebrow"><span></span> PERFORMANCE MARKETING FREELANCER</div>
<h1>Turn digital traffic into <em>measurable growth.</em></h1>
<p class="hero-text">I help businesses attract the right audience, generate better leads and improve conversions through SEO, paid advertising and data-driven marketing.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Free%20Marketing%20Consultation`}>Get a free consultation ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href="#services">View services ↓</a></div>
<div class="proof-row"><div><strong>SEO</strong><span>Organic growth</span></div><div><strong>Google Ads</strong><span>Paid acquisition</span></div><div><strong>Meta Ads</strong><span>Social acquisition</span></div><div><strong>GA4</strong><span>Measurement</span></div></div>
</div>
<div class="hero-card"><div class="card-top"><span>GROWTH FOCUS</span><span class="status">● ACTIVE</span></div><div class="card-number">01</div><h2>More qualified traffic.<br/>Better conversions.</h2><div class="growth-bars"><div><span>SEO</span><i style="width:78%"></i></div><div><span>PAID</span><i style="width:88%"></i></div><div><span>CRO</span><i style="width:68%"></i></div><div><span>DATA</span><i style="width:82%"></i></div></div><p class="demo-note">Strategy framework — illustrative, not client results.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="section intro" id="about"><div class="section-kicker">01 / WHY GROWTHFORGE</div><div class="intro-grid"><h2>Marketing should be a <span>system.</span></h2><div><p>Instead of treating every channel separately, I connect acquisition, landing pages, conversion and measurement so marketing decisions are based on data rather than guesswork.</p><p>My focus is simple: identify the highest-leverage opportunity, build the right system and continuously improve it.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="services"><div class="section-kicker">02 / SERVICES</div><div class="section-heading"><h2>What I can help you <span>grow.</span></h2><p>Flexible freelance support for businesses that need better acquisition, conversion or marketing measurement.</p></div><div class="service-grid">
<article><span>01</span><h3>SEO</h3><p>Build sustainable organic visibility and attract people actively searching for your products or services.</p><ul><li>SEO audits</li><li>Keyword research</li><li>On-page SEO</li><li>Technical SEO</li><li>Content strategy</li><li>Local SEO</li></ul></article>
<article><span>02</span><h3>Google Ads</h3><p>Build structured search campaigns focused on relevant traffic, conversions and efficient acquisition.</p><ul><li>Campaign setup</li><li>Keyword strategy</li><li>Ad copy</li><li>Negative keywords</li><li>Conversion tracking</li><li>Performance optimization</li></ul></article>
<article><span>03</span><h3>Meta Ads</h3><p>Create a practical paid-social system around audiences, creative testing, funnels and measurable outcomes.</p><ul><li>Campaign structure</li><li>Audience strategy</li><li>Creative testing</li><li>Ad copy & hooks</li><li>Retargeting</li><li>Performance analysis</li></ul></article>
<article><span>04</span><h3>CRO & Analytics</h3><p>Understand where users drop off and make your website and tracking work harder.</p><ul><li>Landing page audits</li><li>Conversion optimization</li><li>GA4 setup</li><li>GTM & events</li><li>UTM tracking</li><li>Reporting dashboards</li></ul></article>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-kicker">03 / WHO I HELP</div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Built for businesses that want <span>traction.</span></h2></div><div class="audience-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Service businesses</h3><p>Generate more qualified enquiries and own high-intent searches.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>E-commerce</h3><p>Improve product discovery, acquisition and the path to purchase.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Startups</h3><p>Build a measurable acquisition foundation without unnecessary complexity.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>B2B businesses</h3><p>Connect search, paid campaigns, landing pages and lead measurement.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section work" id="work"><div class="section-kicker">04 / SELECTED PRACTICE WORK</div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Strategy backed by <span>implementation.</span></h2><p>Practice and personal projects created to demonstrate methodology. No fabricated client results.</p></div><div class="case-grid"><article><div class="case-tag">PRACTICE PROJECT / SEO</div><h3>Local SEO Growth System</h3><p>Keyword mapping, local search strategy, on-page improvements, Google Business Profile optimization and measurement planning.</p><div class="tags"><span>SEO</span><span>LOCAL</span><span>GA4</span></div></article><article><div class="case-tag">PERSONAL PROJECT / PPC</div><h3>Search Ads Acquisition Funnel</h3><p>Intent-based campaign structure, ad groups, landing page strategy and conversion tracking for a lead-generation funnel.</p><div class="tags"><span>GOOGLE ADS</span><span>CRO</span><span>GTM</span></div></article><article><div class="case-tag">PRACTICE PROJECT / CONTENT</div><h3>Organic Content Pipeline</h3><p>Topic research, keyword clustering, internal linking and content measurement designed around organic acquisition.</p><div class="tags"><span>SEO</span><span>CONTENT</span><span>GA4</span></div></article></div></section>
<section class="section" id="process"><div class="section-kicker">05 / HOW I WORK</div><div class="section-heading"><h2>Simple process. <span>Clear decisions.</span></h2><p>Every project starts with understanding the business problem before deciding which channel or tactic to use.</p></div><div class="process-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Understand</h3><p>Goals, audience, offer and current marketing setup.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Audit</h3><p>Find gaps, friction and the biggest opportunities.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Prioritize</h3><p>Focus resources on actions with the highest potential impact.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Implement</h3><p>Build campaigns, pages, tracking and optimization systems.</p></article><article><b>05</b><h3>Measure</h3><p>Track meaningful actions and understand what is actually working.</p></article><article><b>06</b><h3>Optimize</h3><p>Learn, improve and scale the strongest opportunities.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section dark offer"><div class="section-kicker">06 / WAYS TO WORK TOGETHER</div><div class="offer-grid"><article><span>ONE-TIME</span><h3>Growth Audit</h3><p>For businesses that want an outside perspective before investing more.</p><ul><li>Marketing & funnel review</li><li>SEO / paid media review</li><li>Tracking review</li><li>Priority recommendations</li></ul></article><article class="featured"><span>PROJECT</span><h3>Growth Setup</h3><p>Build or improve a specific acquisition channel, funnel or measurement system.</p><ul><li>Strategy & implementation</li><li>Campaign or SEO setup</li><li>Landing page recommendations</li><li>Analytics & conversion tracking</li></ul></article><article><span>ONGOING</span><h3>Growth Partner</h3><p>Continuous optimization for businesses that need consistent marketing support.</p><ul><li>Monthly optimization</li><li>Performance reporting</li><li>Testing & experimentation</li><li>Strategic recommendations</li></ul></article></div></section>
<section class="contact" id="contact"><div class="section-kicker">07 / START A CONVERSATION</div><h2>Have a growth problem? <em>Let's talk.</em></h2><p>Tell me what you are trying to achieve, what you are currently doing and where you are stuck. I'll help you identify the next practical step.</p><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button primary" href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Freelance%20Marketing%20Enquiry`}>Email me ↗</a></div><div class="contact-note"><strong>Available for freelance projects</strong><span>SEO · Google Ads · Meta Ads · CRO · GA4 · GTM</span></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><div><div class="footer-brand">GrowthForge<span class="brand-dot">.</span></div><p>Performance marketing focused on acquisition, conversion and measurable growth.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div><div class="footer-bottom">© 2026 GrowthForge Digital · Freelance Marketing</div></footer>
</body>
</html>
<style>
